# madcide keybinding profile: Pico/vised-style single chords — the SAME
# action vocabulary as joe.keys, respelled. Note ^k here is CUT: a chord
# PREFIX in joe.keys, a complete binding in this profile. The adapter is
# data all the way down; a swap is one ui::tui_bind_keys call.
^s save
^q quit
^x discard
^b mark
^k cut
^u paste
^f find
^z undo
^r check
^o outline
^p profile
